# Vincent Valentine (CR 701.27, 608.2d, 702.19, 702.15): "Whenever Vincent Valentine attacks, you may transform it." Bot1 accepts on turn 3: it
# becomes Galian Beast, a 3/2 with trample and lifelink, still attacking, so its 3 damage is dealt to Bot2 and gains Bot1 3 life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Vincent Valentine
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Vincent Valentine.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Vincent Valentine > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Accept
? Bot1.Battlefield.Galian Beast.Transformed = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Galian Beast.Keywords = Lifelink; Trample
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Life = 23
Bot1.Battlefield.Galian Beast.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Galian Beast.Toughness = 2
